      "writtenOn": "2026-07-10T00:44:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here\u0027s the explanation:\nThe Xiaomi driver receives a netmem from __skb_frag_ref() or similar kernel APIs that already hold a reference. It only needs put_netmem to release the reference when done — it never acquires a raw netmem that requires an explicit get_netmem. The reference is obtained implicitly through existing exported GKI functions (__skb_frag_ref, skb_frag_netmem, etc.), so only the release side (put_netmem) needs to be added to the symbol list.",
      "revId": "05b4c7be4f99150f2bb42ddad8b8785b4983238b",
